# R2 / S3 credentials for publish scripts. Never commit — object-scoped
# tokens. Per-crate .gitignore files handle each crate's /target; this
# file only handles repo-root secrets that don't fit that pattern.
/r2.env

# Compose build cache — populated by `cargo compose` and friends;
# per-artifact temp dir, safe to ignore repo-wide.
/.compose/
